ory**: `C:\\\\Users\\\\User\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\medcheck-bd`\\n- **Port**: `5000` (Accessible at `http://localhost:5000`)\\n- **Database**: Live MongoDB connection (`mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/medcheck_bd`) with automated `mongodb-memory-server` fallback for zero-configuration execution.\\n- **Dataset**: Pre-seeded with 22 realistic Bangladeshi medicines (Beximco, Square, Incepta, Renata, Opsonin), 47 batches, 10 pharmacies across Dhaka and major divisions, live inventory, and demo user accounts.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## What Was Built\\n\\n```\\nmedcheck-bd/\\n├── client/\\n│   ├── index.html                 # Public Landing Page & Healthcare Workflow\\n│   ├── login.html                 # 1-Click Multi-Role Demo Login\\n│   ├── register.html              # Customer Registration\\n│   ├── pharmacy-register.html     # Pharmacy Onboarding with License\\n│   ├── verify.html                # Medicine & Batch Verification\\n│   ├── medicine-details.html      # Comprehensive Regulatory Profile\\n│   ├── price.html                 # Price Check & DGDA Variance Engine\\n│   ├── pharmacies.html            # Verified Pharmacy Directory\\n│   ├── pharmacy-details.html      # Pharmacy Live Stock Table\\n│   ├── customer-dashboard.html    # Consumer Activity Hub\\n│   ├── pharmacy-dashboard.html    # Inventory Management & POS Terminal\\n│   ├── admin-dashboard.html       # Admin Portal & Chart.js Analytics\\n│   ├── history.html               # Customer Medicine Timeline\\n│   ├── receipt.html               # Printable Digital Receipt\\n│   ├── report.html                # Suspicious Medicine Reporting\\n│   ├── css/style.css              \n<truncated 7201 bytes>","Description":"\"Create Walkthrough documentation artifact for MedCheck BD\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\User\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\216e255d-b8e0-4484-815a-117107eae7cd\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Create walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Create walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
