{"step_index":152,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:04:54Z","content":"The **“MedCheck BD”** full-stack web application is fully built, tested, and running live.\n\nThe project is located at:\n📁 **[`C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd`](file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/medcheck-bd)**\n\n> [!TIP]\n> You may set `C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\medcheck-bd` as your active workspace in your editor.\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Live Server & Demo Credentials\nThe application is running at **`http://localhost:5000`** with the following 1-click demo accounts:\n\n| Role | Email | Password | Access Capabilities |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Customer** | `customer@gmail.com` | `Customer@123` | Medicine verification, personal check/purchase history, receipts, discrepancy reports |\n| **Pharmacy** | `pharmacy@medcare.com` | `Pharmacy@123` | Real-time inventory CRUD, low stock & expiry tracking, POS sales & digital receipt generator |\n| **Admin** | `admin@medcheckbd.com` | `Admin@1234` | Full Chart.js analytics, 1-click pharmacy approval, medicine registry, audit logs |\n\n---\n\n### 📋 What Has Been Built\n1. **Frontend**: Clean, responsive Bangladesh health-tech UI (Bootstrap 5, custom CSS, Font Awesome 6, Chart.js) across 15 dedicated pages.\n2. **Backend**: Express.js REST API with JWT authentication, bcrypt password hashing, and role-based access control (RBAC).\n3. **Database**: MongoDB with Mongoose schemas (User, Medicine, Batch, Pharmacy, Inventory, Sale, Report, AccessLog, MedicineHistory) with zero-configuration fallback.\n4. **Seed Dataset**: 22 Bangladeshi medicines (Beximco, Square, Incepta, Renata, Opsonin), 47 batches with expiry states, 10 pharmacies, and inventory price variances.\n5. **Security & Compliance**: Access logging audit trails, strict verification labels (**“DATABASE MATCH”**, **“NEEDS REVIEW”**, **“ALERT DETECTED”**), and healthcare disclaimers.\n\nFor full architectural details, test results, and browser verification flows, please view the [`walkthrough.md`](file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/brain/216e255d-b8e0-4484-815a-117107eae7cd/walkthrough.md) and [`README.md`](file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/medcheck-bd/README.md)."}
